#. <CLT 4>外の情報に飢えている…
#. ここでテレビでも見られればな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm starving for information from the outside world.\n"
"If only there was a TV that worked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクたちの調査の様子も…
#. 見てるんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whoever's behind this is probably watching how our\n"
"investigation's going...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ショーウインドウの中には…
#. 手掛かりになりそうなものはないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The display case doesn't seem to be hiding any\n"
"clues...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

